his  niche market. So much so that in 2005 he decided to sell his home and invest  the entire proceeds from the sale into junior mining companies. When his  account had tripled by September, 2007, he decided to quit his job as the  Telecommunications Equipment Buyer at UCLA and make investing in this sector  his full-time job. David founded the Junior Miner Junky subscription-based  newsletter in April, 2017, which has assisted in educating thousands of  investors to become successful speculators in the extremely challenging precious  metals junior resource equity space.\u003c/p\u003e\n\n","email":"oroyplata43@yahoo.com","facebookId":null,"name":"David Erfle","imageUrl":"https://storage.googleapis.com/kitco-auth/user/vBN6iTmZLZVwocPes0WCYYRDeEz2/1706546954517.png","linkedInId":null,"title":null,"twitterId":null,"authorType":"contributor","urlAlias":"/author/david-erfle","roles":["contributor"]},"tags":[{"id":984,"name":"Gold Futures","urlAlias":"/news/tag/gold-futures"},{"id":181,"name":"gold","urlAlias":"/news/tag/gold"},{"id":182,"name":"silver","urlAlias":"/news/tag/silver"},{"id":369,"name":"FOMC","urlAlias":"/news/tag/fomc"},{"id":731,"name":"monetary policy","urlAlias":"/news/tag/monetary-policy"},{"id":796,"name":"March Silver","urlAlias":"/news/tag/march-silver"},{"id":555,"name":"USDX","urlAlias":"/news/tag/usdx"}],"image":{"detail":{"default":{"srcset":"https://image-api.prod.kitco.com/image/cc0418af-c887-45c9-8a03-094121e7f42b.png?top=80\u0026left=0\u0026width=1536\u0026height=864\u0026scale_width=1920\u0026token=06d66ef7263e0af36a571de150029d481a5cda58c8c662be176fa63d45737480"},"sources":{"teaser_small":{"srcset":"https://image-api.prod.kitco.com/image/cc0418af-c887-45c9-8a03-094121e7f42b.png?top=80\u0026left=0\u0026width=1536\u0026height=864\u0026scale_width=200\u0026token=21323320da5f1d4e09fe97ce537c3a8c9631210ba48dbbc78069fe89696fba45","media":"all and (min-width: 0px)"},"teaser_medium":{"srcset":"https://image-api.prod.kitco.com/image/cc0418af-c887-4